<title>USA: Infoseek names Motro as CEO.</title>
<headline>Infoseek names Motro as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Infoseek Corp said it named Harry Motro, 36, was elected as chief executive officer and to the board of directors.</p>
<p>Motro succeeds Robin Johnson, who announced his resignation as CEO and director effective immediately.</p>
<p>Johnson, who joined Infoseek in December 1995, will continue to work with the company as a consultant during the next several months to ensure a smooth transition.</p>
<p>Motro joined Infoseek as president in April from CNN Interactive, where he was the founder of CNN's three premier Web sites -- CNN Interactive, CNNfn and All Politics.</p>
